  "victory": {
    "side": "ger",
    "text": "The Germans win if, at the end of turn 8, they control at least three of the five Soviet strongpoints: the assembly hall, the north shop and the works office on the works board, and the church and the tractor shop on the city board. A building is controlled by the side that has an unbroken infantry unit in it and no enemy units in any of its hexes. Otherwise the Soviets win.",
